  "body": "https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-fetch\n\n> 1. Let _response_ be the result of performing a CORS preflight fetch using _request_.\n> 2. If _response_ is a network error, return _response_.\n\n_response_ is already used for a variable introduced in step 1, which I think this variable is supposed to shadow. It would be clearer to use \"preflight response\", say.\n",
